  "commit_message": "fix(executive): fall back to polling on error\n\nRather than assuming a process has exited when we can't block waiting\nfor it, fall back to polling.\n\nAssuming a PID has exited on error could lead to a loop where we\ncontinuosly re-monitor the same PID.",
